t\">l.</span><br><br><span class=\"EnglishFont\">We ask you to remember us /</span><br><span class=\"EnglishFont\">O our faithful advocate /</span><br><span class=\"EnglishFont\">before our Lord Jesus Christ /</span><br><span class=\"EnglishFont\">that He may forgive us our sins /</span>"}}]}},{"id":"doxology-transfiguration","name":"Doxology","formats":{"1":[{"name":"Standard","contentType":"Text","content":{"paragraphs":[{"columns":[{"language":"coptic","content":""},{"language":"english","content":"Let us praise Christ, our God: the One in essence with the Father: who, through His divinity, made: the living and the dead."},{"language":"arabic","content":""}]},{"columns":[{"language":"Coptic","content":""},{"language":"English","content":"Jesus Christ the only-begotten: went to the top of Mount Tabor: He took with Him His disciples: Peter and James and John."},{"language":"Arabic","content":""}],"isComment":false},{"columns":[{"language":"Coptic","content":""},{"language":"English","content":"And He appeared before them: His face shone more than the sun: His clothes looked like snow: and two prophets appeared to Him."},{"language":"Arabic","content":""}],"isComment":false},{"columns":[{"language":"Coptic","content":""},{"language":"English","content":"Elijah and Moses, the strong: saw His clothes on Tabor: the disciples passed: through a bright cloud."},{"language":"Arabic","content":""}],"isComment":false},{"columns":[{"language":"Coptic","content":""},{"language":"English","content":"And, behold, there was a voice from heaven: coming from God, the Father: saying, \"This is my beloved Son: He has done My will, listen to Him.\""},{"language":"Arabic","content":""}],"isComment":false},{"columns":[{"language":"Coptic","content":""},{"language":"English","content":"We praise and glorify Him: and exalt Him above all: as the Good One and Lover of Mankind: have mercy on us according to Your great mercy."},{"language":"Arabic","content":""}],"isComment":false},{"columns":[{"language":"Coptic","content":""},{"language":"English","content":"Alleluia Alleluia: Alleluia Alleluia: Jesus Christ the Son of God: was transfigured on Mount Tabor."},{"language":"Arabic","content":""}],"isComment":false},{"columns":[{"language":"Coptic","content":""},{"language":"English","content":"This is He to whom is due glory: with His good Father: and the Holy Spirit: both now and forever."},{"language":"Arabic","content":""}],"isComment":false}]}}]}},{"id":"psalm-response-transfiguration","name":"Psalm Response","formats":{"1":[{"name":"Standard","contentType":"Text","content":{"paragraphs":[{"columns":[{"language":"coptic","content":""},{"language":"english","content":"Alleluia Alleluia: Jesus Christ the Son of God, was transfigured on Mount Tabor, Alleluia Alleluia."},{"language":"arabic","content":""}]}]}}]}},{"id":"gospel-response-transfiguration","name":"Gospel Response","formats":{"1":[{"name":"Standard","contentType":"Text","content":{"paragraphs":[{"columns":[{"language":"coptic","content":""},{"language":"english","content":"Alleluia (4) Jesus Christ, the Son of God, was transfigured on Mount Tabor."},{"language":"arabic","content":""}]},{"columns":[{"language":"Coptic","content":""},{"language":"English","content":"This is He to whom is due glory: with His good Father: and the Holy Spirit: both now and forever."},{"language":"Arabic","content":""}],"isComment":false},{"columns":[{"language":"Coptic","content":""},{"language":"English","content":"Blessed be the Father and the Son / and the Holy Spirit / the perfect Trinity / we worship Him and glorify Him."},{"language":"Arabic","content":""}],"isComment":false}]}}]}},{"id":"concluding-hymn-transfiguration","name":"Concluding Hymn","formats":{"1":[{"name":"Standard","contentType":"Text","content":{"paragraphs":[{"columns":[{"language":"coptic","content":""},{"language":"english","content":"Amen. Alleluia. Glory to the Father, and to the Son, and to the Holy Spirit."},{"language":"arabic","content":""}]},{"columns":[{"language":"Coptic","content":""},{"language":"English","content":"Now and ever and unto the age of the ages. Amen."},{"language":"Arabic","content":""}],"isComment":false},{"columns":[{"language":"Coptic","content":""},{"language":"English","content":"We proclaim and say, O our Lord Jesus Christ,"},{"language":"Arabic","content":""}],"isComment":false},{"columns":[{"language":"Coptic","content":""},{"language":"English","content":"On the Feast of Transfiguration"},{"language":"Arabic","content":""}],"isComment":true},{"columns":[{"language":"Coptic","content":""},{"language":"English","content":"The Son of God, was transfigured on mount Tabor. Save us and have mercy on us."},{"language":"Arabic","content":""}],"isComment":false},{"columns":[{"language":"Coptic","content":""},{"language":"English","content":"Lord have mercy. Lord have mercy. Lord bless us. Amen. Bless me. Bless me. Lo, the repentance. Forgive me. Say the blessing."},{"language":"Arabic","content":""}],"isComment":false}]}}]}}]},{"id":"transfiguration-liturgy","name":"Liturgy","hymns":[{"id":"the-hymn-of-the-censer-tai-shouri-annual","name":"The Hymn of the Censer (Tai Shouri)","formats":{"1":[{"name":"The Hymn of the Censer (Tai Shouri)","contentType":"Text","content":{"paragraphs":[{"columns":[{"content":"This censer of pure gold, bearing the aroma, is in the hands of Aaron the priest, offering up incense upon the altar.","language":"English"},{"content":"Taisoury `nnoub `nka;aroc etfai qa pi`arwmata etqen nenjij `nA`arwn piouyb eftale ou`c;oinoufi `e`pswi `ejen pima`nerswousi.","language":"Coptic"},{"content":"هذه المجمرة الذهب النقي الحاملة العنبر، التي في يدي هرون الكاهن، يرفع بخورا على المذبح.","language":"Arabic"}]}],"contentType":"TextContent"}}],"2":[{"name":"The Hymn of the Censer (Tai Shouri)","contentType":"Hazzat","content":{"copticHazzat":"<span class=\"CopticFont\">Ta</span><span class=\"HazzatFont\">zzq c c edd </span><span class=\"CopticFont\">isou</span><span 